.pixi/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
# pytest-benchmark 的自动存档（`pixi run bench`）
.benchmarks/
# 案例的渲染产物与按需拉取的上游参考图（纳管策略见 docs/notes/snapshot-policy.md）
docs/cases/*/current/
docs/cases/*/expected/
# generated network assets for the E1 spike (recreated by `pixi run spike:assets`)
docs/spike/e1_coldstart/static/
# Playwright browser downloads for the E1 spike (read-only $HOME in the runtime)
.playwright-browsers/
# `pixi run gate:metrics` 的中间产物与报告（每次重跑覆盖，不入库）
.gate-metrics/
# `pixi run cases:matrix` 的运行时报告（红绿 + 差多少），每次重跑覆盖，不入库
.cases-matrix/
# `pixi run gate:pyodide` 的两侧产物（IR 字节 + 元数据），每次重跑覆盖，不入库
.gate-pyodide/
